                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "\"What if Space Quest and Monkey Island had a baby?\"  -  Well that hypothetical is answered here. Honestly I don't think this is really a bad thing trying to emulate two absolute gems in the Point 'n' Click Genre, especially as Space Quest is direly due an update and I love a good Sci-Fi vibe to my PnC's  \nIt's a relatively short game if I had to give it any semblance of negativity, and it does suffer for its imitation in that a few puzzle answers are your classic Must Trade Landmine for Baby Doll Head to Give to The Tiki Tribe in Exchange for a Mask to enter the Voodoo-You-Do-Lounge to get a Drink to Drug the Guard to Lil Guardsman and Invade Czechoslovakia.  \n\nYou all know what I mean by this, the classic nonsensical puzzles.  However, it was relatively quick, it was cheerful and I had a good time.",
